<title>UK: BOE allots 244 mln stg to discount houses via repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 244 mln stg to discount houses via repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided a total of 244 million stg to the discount houses via repo.</p>
<p>The Bank had earlier provided liquidity totalling 689 million stg to the market after forecasting a shortage of 900 million.</p>
</text>
